{'symbol': 'KDP', 'date': '2022-05-19 16:30:00', 'title': 'KEURIG DR PEPPER DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "BURLINGTON, MASS. AND FRISCO, TEXAS , MAY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEURIG DR PEPPER (NASDAQ: KDP) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.1875 PER SHARE, PAYABLE IN U.S. DOLLARS, ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK."}